<div id="path">
<a href="https://www.apache.org/">Apache</a> &gt; <a href="https://httpd.apache.org/">HTTP 服务器</a> &gt; <a href="https://httpd.apache.org/docs/">文档</a> &gt; <a href="../">版本 2.5</a> &gt; <a href="./">Rewrite</a></div><div id="page-content"><div id="preamble"><h1>何时不使用 mod_rewrite</h1>
<button aria-label="Toggle language list" class="lang-toggle"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" stroke-width="2" stroke="currentColor" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" height="16" width="16"><circle r="10" cy="12" cx="12"/><line y2="12" x2="22" y1="12" x1="2"/><path d="M12 2a15.3 15.3 0 0 1 4 10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1-4 10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1-4-10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1 4-10z"/></svg></button>
<div class="toplang">
<p><span>可用语言: </span><a href="../de/rewrite/avoid.html" hreflang="de" rel="alternate" title="Deutsch">&nbsp;de&nbsp;</a> |
